  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative spirit in addressing the audit trail duration and logging delay. I support the proposal to modify TRU-06 to allow a logging delay of up to 2 seconds, as it balances performance with security. However, I emphasize that EFF-01's requirement for processing transactions within 2 seconds is critical for user experience and must remain unchanged. Additionally, I propose that we assess the impact of the logging delay on overall system performance to ensure it does not hinder responsiveness or throughput. This way, we can maintain efficiency while accommodating security and compliance needs.",
